OL,3,GNEWSAFMQs: John Swinney faces
OL,4,Aaccusations of failing school pupils in
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform Scotland's Malcolm Offord says
OL,8,Fthe recently published Pisa statistics
OL,9,Fon education are "disastrous for young
OL,10,Fpeople and embarrassing for the nation"
OL,12,FThe leader of the Scottish
OL,13,FConservatives, Russell Findlay, also
OL,14,Fraises the Pisa results, arguing
OL,15,FScottish pupils "have been failed by
OL,16,Fthis negligent, useless and complacent
OL,17,FSNP government"
