OL,3,GNEWSAFMQs: John Swinney faces
OL,4,Aaccusations of failing school pupils in
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first minister says the
OL,8,Finternational survey, which saw
OL,9,FScotland falling slightly in reading
OL,10,Fand maths, is just one measure and
OL,11,Fthere are plenty of other metrics
OL,12,Fshowing Scottish education is working
OL,14,FLabour's Jackie Baillie raises the
OL,15,Ftraumatic cases of women who have had
OL,16,Fmiscarriages, saying the SNP
OL,17,Fgovernment's approach to maternity and
OL,18,Fgynaecology health is failing
