OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Swinney says he is very sorry
OL,8,Fabout the experiences the women have
OL,9,Fhad, but his government has "commenced
OL,10,Fa whole series of inspections [of
OL,11,Fmaternity units] around the country"
OL,13,FScottish Green co-leader Gillian Mackay
OL,14,Fcalled for the SNP government to
OL,15,Fpublicly object to plans for a
OL,16,Fcontroversial new gas field off the
OL,17,Fcoast of Aberdeen
